*--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* amy.def : STed2 tone list from AMY patches.h comments
*           Each name is at most 12 characters, the DEF tone-name width.
*           Bank 0 is Juno (patches 0-127). Bank 1 is DX7 (patches 128-255).
*           The extra part is patches 256-258. Bank 3 programs 0-6 are patches 384-390.
*           Patches 259-383 are reserved in patches.h and are not listed.
*--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

* 使用する音源の機種名(表示用=module/内部処理用=id)
#module= MODULE: AMY Synthesizer

#id=AMY

